### Laundry Booking API Tests

### Variables
@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@token =

### Register a new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "pin": "1234"
}

### Login user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "pin": "1234"
}

### Book a time slot (requires token from login response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/book
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

{
  "bookingDate": "2026-01-20",
  "timeSlotNumber": 1
}

### Get available slots for a date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/available/2026-01-20

### Get user's bookings (requires token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/my-bookings
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### Unbook a time slot (requires token)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/unbook/1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
